# ==========================================
# SocialSync AI Environment Variables
# ==========================================

# 1. CLIENT-SIDE SUPABASE CREDENTIALS (EXPO_PUBLIC_*)
# Safe to bundle in mobile app. Must be your Supabase Project URL and Public Anon Key.
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-public-anon-key

# 2. SERVER-SIDE CREDENTIALS (SUPABASE EDGE FUNCTIONS ONLY)
# NEVER put these in client code or prefix with EXPO_PUBLIC_.
# Set these in your Supabase Dashboard -> Project Settings -> Edge Functions Secrets.
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your-supabase-service-role-key
# OPENAI_API_KEY=your-openai-api-key-for-ai-studio

# 3. DEMO MODE
# By default, if Supabase credentials are not set, SocialSync automatically runs in Demo Mode.
